              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">17mg</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">Social/Pub</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">LOOP Jalapeño Lime Strong</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">~13.5mg</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">Morning Coffee</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">ZYN Espressini Slim S4</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">4mg</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">Before Bed</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">ZYN Gentle Mint Slim</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">6.5mg</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">Long Drive</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">Skruf Fresh Mint Strong</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">~11mg</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">Studying/Focus</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">KLAR Mint Slim</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">3mg</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2>How to Build Your Collection</h2>

        <p>Most people who use nicotine pouches regularly end up with 2–4 favorites. Start with one pouch that matches your most common scenario. A realistic collection: a mild, discreet pouch for work (1–9mg), a stronger pouch for the gym (15mg+), and maybe a fun social flavor for weekends. Three pouches covering 90% of your real-world moments.</p>

        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Can I use the same pouch for everything?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">Technically, yes—but you'll probably be frustrated. Most people find that having 2–3 options makes the whole experience better.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">What's the most discreet pouch for work?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">ON! Mint Extra Strong Mini. It's genuinely the smallest pouch on the market. ZYN Spearmint Mini runs a close second at 1.5mg.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Should I use stronger pouches for the gym?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">Yes. Go for 15mg+. VELO Freezing Peppermint MAX at 17mg is perfect for gym use.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Is it OK to use pouches before bed?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">Light pouches (3–6.5mg) are fine if you find them relaxing. Strong pouches are not—nicotine can disrupt sleep quality. Give yourself 30–60 minutes before trying to sleep.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">How many pouches should I use per day?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">Most regular users average 4–6 pouches daily, spread across their day.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border rounded-lg p-4 my-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">What's the best all-rounder if I only want one brand?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2">ZYN is probably your safest bet—consistent quality, wide range of strengths, multiple formats, and reliable flavor. Go for their standard Mint in 4–6mg.</p>
        </details>

        <h2>Closing Thought</h2>

        <p>The best nicotine pouch isn't the "strongest" or the most "popular." It's the one that matches what you're actually doing in that moment. Start with one pouch for your main scenario, try it for a week or two, then add a second for a different moment.</p>

        <p>Explore our <a href="/brands/zyn">ZYN collection</a>, <a href="/brands/velo">VELO range</a>, <a href="/brands/loop">LOOP flavors</a>, <a href="/brands/on">ON! options</a>, <a href="/brands/skruf">Skruf strength</a>, <a href="/brands/klar">KLAR pouches</a>, and <a href="/brands/helwit">HELWIT selection</a>. Or start with our <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-your-strength">guide to choosing your strength</a> and <a href="/blog/how-to-use-nicotine-pouches">how to use nicotine pouches</a> if you're new. And if you're brand new to all this, our <a href="/beginners">beginner's guide</a> covers the basics.</p>

